      "category": "Perform Intermediate Faller Specific Duties",
      "behavior": null,
      "level": null,
      "verbatim_text": "Utilize the “outside-in, top-down” approach to perform a hazard assessment. Hazards should be articulated and mitigation controls developed and implemented if necessary.",
